What is Legal Analytics?
Legal Analytics is a technology-driven discipline that utilizes quantitative analysis and data mining techniques to transform legal information into actionable insights. It covers predictive, descriptive, and prescriptive analysis to inform strategy, mitigate risk, and improve operational efficiency across legal departments, law firms, and regulatory bodies.
